      <title>星宇股份就调岗减员错误道歉，107名同学中71人已入职新单位</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260907/%E6%98%9F%E5%AE%87%E8%82%A1%E4%BB%BD%E5%B0%B1%E8%B0%83%E5%B2%97%E5%87%8F%E5%91%98%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E9%81%93%E6%AD%89107%E5%90%8D%E5%90%8C%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%AD71%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%B2%E5%85%A5%E8%81%8C%E6%96%B0%E5%8D%95%E4%BD%8D/</link>
